    {
      "id": 39,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "description": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 2,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Jenkins 构建监控（推送管道 `jenkins_build_*`）\n数据经 Jenkins Collector → `POST /api/v1/ingest/build` → Exporter；与上方文件管道（`ops_job_*`）共用同一 Prometheus job。`$jenkins_job` 为本区块独立任务变量。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "构建总数（24h）",
      "description": "近 24h 被接受的构建数（Counter increase，自动处理 exporter 重启归零）。完全无数据时显示 No data；有序列但无增量时显示 0，避免假绿。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 26
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(jenkins_build_total[24h])) or (count(jenkins_build_total) > 0) * 0",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
